// F4 SE-017: keyboard navigation between panels — ⌥⌘] / ⌥⌘[ (View ▸ Next / Previous panel) cycle Media → Player →
// Editing panel → Timeline with an accent focus ring; the timeline takes the keyboard; a click hides the ring.
{
  "project": "demo",
  "steps": [
    {"idle": 1},
    {"key": "cmd+opt+]"},
    {"expect": [{"path": "ui.focusedPanel", "equals": "assets"}, {"path": "ui.anchors", "contains": "focusRing.assets"}]},
    {"key": "cmd+opt+]"},
    {"expect": {"path": "ui.focusedPanel", "equals": "player"}},
    {"key": "cmd+opt+]"},
    {"expect": {"path": "ui.focusedPanel", "equals": "inspector"}},
    {"snapshot": "f4-focus-ring-inspector"},
    {"key": "cmd+opt+]"},
    {"expect": [{"path": "ui.focusedPanel", "equals": "timeline"}, {"path": "ui.firstResponder", "equals": "TimelineView"}]},
    {"key": "cmd+opt+]"},
    {"expect": {"path": "ui.focusedPanel", "equals": "assets"}},
    {"key": "cmd+opt+["},
    {"expect": {"path": "ui.focusedPanel", "equals": "timeline"}},
    {"click": "clip:main/1"},
    {"expect": {"path": "ui.focusedPanel", "equals": ""}}
  ]
}
